Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:47.44,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(765,540)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:51.85,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:54.18,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,raising our battle cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:00:56.82,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,498)}Raw provider\N{\fs40}SOFCJ-Raws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:58.52,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.69,0:01:00.96,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.33,0:01:11.53,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,That feeling we had when we set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:15.04,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,is something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:16.81,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Because of that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:20.48,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,nothing will be able to scare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:26.75,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now, as the trip approaches, our racing heartbeats
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.93,0:01:33.69,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,engrave a rhythm of adventure in our shy hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:38.06,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:40.36,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:44.77,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:47.40,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.53,0:02:04.62,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fill your empty heart with dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.75,0:02:06.96,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:11.29,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you color your heart with the blowing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.39,0:02:13.63,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,you will move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:17.80,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.97,0:02:20.13,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.27,0:02:24.49,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.67,0:02:27.28,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:32.93,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(1000,0)}激突！\N對殭屍900號的巨人戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.03,0:02:38.30,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,他們沒有通緝令。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.77,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,也就是說剩下的是...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:43.74,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,之前那個戴草帽的...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:45.98,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,一個橘色的女人...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:48.45,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,還有一個帥氣的英雄。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:51.88,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,還少三個人。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.20,0:02:55.60,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,他們會在哪裡呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:00.86,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,她醒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.18,0:03:02.05,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:05.09,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我討厭蟑螂！把牠們弄掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.09,0:03:06.85,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,不是蟑螂！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:02.94,Secondary,Zombie,0,0,0,,培羅娜大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:03.95,Secondary,Zombie,0,0,0,,培羅娜大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:05.63,Secondary,Zombie,0,0,0,,請冷靜！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.63,0:03:06.85,Secondary,Zombie,0,0,0,,沒有那種東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:10.28,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:14.30,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,敵人已經不在這裡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.30,0:03:17.07,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,你失去了意識。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:19.63,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,發生了什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:21.55,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,而且是你這種人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:24.02,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,大宅怎麼了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:26.34,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,是海賊幹的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:29.22,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,海賊確實造成了不少麻煩，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:32.11,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,這些是奧茲肆意破壞的痕跡。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:33.02,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,奧茲？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.35,0:03:38.85,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,而且，根據我們的報告，奧茲消滅了所有的將軍殭屍。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.36,0:03:41.20,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,最強軍隊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.54,0:03:44.43,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,奧茲失控了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.43,0:03:46.22,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,嗯，那是-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.01,0:03:51.90,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.90,0:03:52.84,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,兄弟們！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:55.29,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:03:58.75,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,奧、奧茲？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.61,0:04:03.57,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,順、順帶一提，霍古巴克大人好像被踩了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:04.49,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:07.10,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,這裡沒有女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:08.76,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:10.29,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:13.63,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,糟了，我得離開這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:17.50,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,Thriller Bark正在被奧茲和海賊們破壞！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.21,0:04:21.13,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,快！收集糧食和寶物！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.13,0:04:23.80,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,放到他們的海賊船上之後，我們就走！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:24.58,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,他們的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.78,0:04:26.36,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,草帽一夥的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.36,0:04:27.90,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我們要乘他們的船逃走！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:28.56,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:30.62,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,是，馬上！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:32.85,Captions,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(600,0)}同時，在一間空房間裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:36.72,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,好了，宣誓之吻。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:44.63,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:45.23,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,等、等、等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:46.03,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.03,0:04:47.33,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不要！住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.42,0:04:50.05,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你醒了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.05,0:04:51.25,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,那就放棄吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.17,0:04:56.70,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我一吻你，你就會成為我的妻子。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:59.54,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我說不要！你這隱形的變態獸人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:02.30,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我還想繼續冒險！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:03.27,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,安靜點接受吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.27,0:05:06.35,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你將成為墓場之王的妻子！墓場女王！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:07.84,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不要！那是什麼啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:14.44,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,可惡的娜美藏！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:19.98,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,蘿-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:21.10,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:23.45,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,娜美藏...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:26.37,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:29.91,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你怎麼能背叛我？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:35.21,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,之前說支持我的那些話全是謊言！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:39.29,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,什麼支持？！你明明想從我手中搶走阿布大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:41.15,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你算什麼朋友？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:44.34,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,等、等一下，蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:46.35,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我一直都昏迷著。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.35,0:05:47.92,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我不知道發生了-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:49.44,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,婚紗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:50.50,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我為什麼穿著這個？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:51.28,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,好漂亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.90,0:05:54.55,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,什麼漂亮，你這叛徒！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.55,0:05:56.90,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,等等！這是誤會！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:58.79,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,可惡，蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.79,0:06:02.64,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你不僅打斷了我的婚禮，還想傷害我的新娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.75,0:06:05.06,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,閉嘴，娶我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:05.93,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,想都別想！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.46,0:06:10.16,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,阿布大人，你不知道吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:13.66,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,這個女人的真名是娜美藏！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:16.84,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,而且她其實是男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.95,0:06:19.39,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:21.80,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:24.63,Thoughts,Nami,0,0,0,,我確實說過那種話...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:29.47,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,但是，在浴室的時候我確實...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:38.82,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,消失吧，娜美藏！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:40.44,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,住手，蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:43.36,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,喂，夠了，蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:44.48,Thoughts,Nami,0,0,0,,她沒打中...？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:46.30,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,娜美藏。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.15,0:06:47.93,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,蘿拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:49.66,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,快逃，娜美藏。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:52.47,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我來纏住他。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:55.71,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我是來救你的，我的朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:06:58.56,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:00.23,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,阿布大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:06.54,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,既然你知道了真相，阿布薩羅姆，忘了她吧，娶我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:08.03,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,蘿拉...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:11.64,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我的新娘在逃跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:14.15,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我才是你的新娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.15,0:07:16.96,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,她毫無疑問是女人，蘿拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:20.29,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:25.61,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:36.54,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,多管閒事的殭屍...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:42.14,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,浪費了我的力氣。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.64,0:07:53.22,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,很聰明...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:55.75,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你停下來不跑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:58.07,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,不管怎樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:01.57,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你逃不過我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:05.45,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我可是隱形人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:07.05,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}蓄電！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:10.77,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你敢！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.81,0:08:14.44,Flashbacks,Lola,0,0,0,,我是來救你的，我的朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:17.34,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你竟敢傷害蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.35,0:08:30.12,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,就是這樣！直接投入我的懷抱吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:32.82,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}迴轉臂！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:37.60,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,反正也傷不了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.62,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.02,0:08:55.47,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,怎麼可能？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:58.05,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,之前在橋上的時候，他沒有感覺到。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:04.61,Thoughts,Zombie,0,0,0,,果然... 他之前跟那個男人戰鬥時已經消耗了體力。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:06.12,Thoughts,Zombie,0,0,0,,一定是那樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.45,0:09:08.04,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,算了，無所謂。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:09.32,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我贏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:14.20,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我一定是打中了弱點！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:16.96,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:19.22,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:20.19,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,撐住！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:25.11,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,謝謝你來救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:27.94,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,為什麼要謝我呢，娜美藏？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.79,0:09:31.36,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我們是朋友啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:37.78,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,但是... 那時候，我因為害怕你所以撒了謊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:39.42,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,對不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:42.29,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我其實是女人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:45.89,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你真傻。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:47.89,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:49.75,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,蘿拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:54.97,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,更重要的是！現在阿布大人正在沒有防備的狀態！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:59.20,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你現在就當我的丈夫吧，阿布薩羅姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.09,0:10:08.89,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,你們在嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:12.02,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,出來吧，草帽小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:13.67,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:15.59,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,帥氣英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:18.30,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他叫什麼名字來著？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:19.74,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我想想...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:21.74,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,應該叫羅斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:23.57,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不，你搞錯了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.57,0:10:26.09,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,結尾是...「茲」。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:27.95,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,弗茲。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.95,0:10:30.66,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,哇，那也差太遠了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.66,0:10:31.70,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,烏茲？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:35.40,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,還是少了什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:36.39,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,奧茲。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.39,0:10:37.74,Main,All,0,0,0,,就是那個！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.23,0:10:42.19,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,不好意思... 抱歉，我的身體...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.19,0:10:44.51,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,嗯，別擔心。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:46.16,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你還能動嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.16,0:10:46.95,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,能。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:48.33,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那就退到旁邊去。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:51.02,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,喂，奧茲！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:10:59.34,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,如果你體內有魯夫的影子...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:03.63,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,那你應該已經知道你絕對不該...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:06.36,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,小看你船員的實力。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.87,0:11:19.51,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,你們還挺耐打的嘛，小海賊們。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.03,0:11:33.45,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我有個提議給大家...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.19,0:11:37.34,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,把這傢伙翻過來怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:39.84,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,原來如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:42.79,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,那確實是好主意。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.79,0:11:44.16,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,等、等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:46.32,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,翻、翻過來？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:48.91,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這麼巨大的東西？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:54.59,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,不過，有了這種巨大的體型，魯夫的招式更加驚人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.59,0:11:57.83,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,但他一點都不像「海賊王」的樣子。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:12:00.54,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,要怎麼打？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:03.30,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,有無數種方法。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:06.04,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他一定有弱點。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.36,0:12:11.11,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,釣大魚的時候，最常見的戰術就是一點一點消耗牠的體力。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.66,0:12:13.29,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,如果是那個計劃的話，那我...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:16.45,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,太害怕了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.45,0:12:17.45,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我要壓扁你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.45,0:12:18.30,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:23.52,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:25.10,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}屁股撞擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:28.39,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那算什麼攻擊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:30.22,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,散開！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:36.80,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鐮刀！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.02,0:12:43.16,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:45.41,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那樣的話，就讓你們見識...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.41,0:12:48.26,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我們的合體力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.15,0:12:50.21,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你們兩個！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:51.50,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.76,0:12:54.27,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,戰術十五號！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:56.27,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:58.22,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,不會吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.22,0:13:00.16,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我們要在這裡用「那個」嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:01.20,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:01.80,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,捲眉毛！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.80,0:13:02.66,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,就位！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.65,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,抓住我的腿就行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:08.53,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他要做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:10.06,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:23.66,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}海賊合體六號...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:25.40,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}巨大機器人戰士...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:29.84,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}大帝王！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.49,0:13:35.09,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,等一下，佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.09,0:13:38.23,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,左臂還沒合體！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.23,0:13:41.40,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.66,0:13:43.50,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂，妮可·羅賓你在等什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.50,0:13:45.86,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,趕快接上我的左臂！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.86,0:13:47.34,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,羅賓，快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:48.42,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,來吧，羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:49.67,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,跟我一樣做！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:52.09,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,作為一個人，那太丟臉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:58.48,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,你為什麼停下來了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:00.64,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你為什麼也受打擊了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:02.29,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我剛才都開始興奮了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.00,0:14:05.10,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,做啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.10,0:14:07.68,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,合體啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.99,0:14:14.77,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,太荒謬了！真不敢相信他們竟然讓我做那種事。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:16.93,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,不，忘了那件事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.24,0:14:22.93,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,羅賓，如果你加入的話，我們就能完成機器人戰士大帝王了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.93,0:14:25.53,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我從沒想過你會背叛我們！從來沒有！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:28.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,魯夫的話一定會做的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.81,0:14:31.20,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,別再叫我...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:32.42,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,做你們的合體了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:38.66,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,報仇的時候到了，你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:40.02,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:43.53,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我借這個大傢伙用一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.47,0:14:48.37,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你！那是我的超重雙截棍！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:49.80,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,沒辦法了，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:50.72,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,借你吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:53.31,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你這混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:58.11,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我得趕快去重新拯救娜美小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:06.06,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,你？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:07.95,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:13.31,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,等我爬到他的左臂上，你就對付關節！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:15.86,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,了解。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.27,0:15:27.51,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,培羅娜大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:30.09,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,冰箱已經滿了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.09,0:15:31.88,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,塞不下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:34.05,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,還有食品儲藏室不是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.05,0:15:34.84,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,收到。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.53,0:15:37.27,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,快把寶物搬上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.27,0:15:39.58,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,把剩下的也裝上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:41.64,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,{\i1}收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:43.19,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:45.62,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺特製油星！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:47.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(555,702)}三
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:47.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(605,702)}連
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:47.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(697,702)}射！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.55,0:15:54.87,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂，捲眉毛！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:56.66,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,丟我過去！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.66,0:15:59.70,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,扛著那麼大的東西...？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:01.51,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你搬不動就算了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:03.93,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.93,0:16:05.31,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我當然搬得動，白癡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.11,0:16:07.98,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}空軍...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.11,0:16:07.98,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}空軍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:11.82,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}力量射擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:16.70,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}大劍一擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.99,0:16:23.56,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}百輪花...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.99,0:16:23.56,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}百輪花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:29.07,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}大樹！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.72,0:16:32.10,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,什、什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:41.73,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,危、危險... 我要掉了！要掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.73,0:16:43.38,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,看好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:48.02,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我的超級即席空中階梯！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.43,0:16:53.82,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}佛朗基空中漫步！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:57.96,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,但是... 這個立足點撐不了多久了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:17:00.14,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,出發了，喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:02.07,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:08.19,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}超級...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:10.66,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}重擊...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.66,0:17:11.57,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鉗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.16,0:17:21.12,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,不管體型多大，人體的弱點都是一樣的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:24.59,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,打中你的下巴就能震動你的腦子。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:34.43,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,現在你唯一的支撐就是那條腿了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.82,0:17:37.55,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,怪物魯夫。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:41.32,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}反禮儀...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.62,0:17:43.84,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}踢擊...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.51,0:17:47.45,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}路線！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.35,0:17:53.65,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,把那個怪物完全翻過來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:55.55,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好！倒下去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.34,0:18:04.26,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,搞定一個。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:11.34,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,喂喂！這裡已經看不出是大宅了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:13.96,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,那是什麼招式？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:15.04,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,特技表演嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:17.98,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,難、難道...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:20.44,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,有人把他翻過來了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:23.78,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,用點腦子想想吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.78,0:18:26.47,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,就算有一千人的軍隊也做不到那種事。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:37.29,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我沒事的，娜美藏。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.29,0:18:39.62,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你先逃走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:42.37,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,讓我來說明一下目前的狀況。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:43.83,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,蘿拉...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:46.88,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你的朋友，草帽魯夫...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:52.09,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,擁有他影子的特殊殭屍正在島上到處肆虐。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:57.37,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,就是我們在冷凍室看到的那個殭屍。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:18:58.75,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,太麻煩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:19:01.36,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們要怎麼從那個怪物手中奪回魯夫的影子？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:02.64,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:07.06,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,經歷了這場噩夢之後，我絕對不會空手而歸！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.39,0:19:08.52,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.52,0:19:09.56,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,而且沒有上鎖！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.13,0:19:29.81,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,你們這些混蛋...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.81,0:19:32.18,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我受夠你們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:38.42,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我要把你們全部碾碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.89,0:19:47.07,Thoughts,Pelona,0,0,0,,反正我只是為了好玩才跟著莫利亞大人的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.07,0:19:50.90,Thoughts,Pelona,0,0,0,,我的命要是有危險，我當然不會留下來。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:54.85,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,好了，大家快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.85,0:19:57.24,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我們得盡快離開這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:19:58.98,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,是。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:03.18,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,好！把剩下的糧食裝上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:10.77,Main,Bunny,0,0,0,,你是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.77,0:20:12.22,Main,Bunny,0,0,0,,你不是殭屍吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.22,0:20:13.82,Main,Bunny,0,0,0,,你在這裡做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.20,0:20:16.54,Main,Bunny,0,0,0,,好巨大的身體...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:18.43,Main,Bunny,0,0,0,,你看起來就像一頭熊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.13,0:20:21.76,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,熊嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.36,0:20:25.17,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,那倒是正確答案。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:27.23,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,莫利亞...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.11,0:20:30.64,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,在這附近嗎？
